{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SsjDZR88FU9tqpsy6UcsU6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"schema_version\": 1,\n3\t  \"task_file\": \"/home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/research/smoketest/md/task.prompt.md\",\n4\t  \"slot_count\": 3,\n5\t  \"constraint_count\": 2,\n6\t  \"slots\": [\n7\t    {\"ordinal\": 1, \"title\": \"Metals ranked by melting point\", \"instruction\": \"All metals referenced in the KB are ranked by melting point from highest to lowest. Content is presented as a sorted list.\"},\n8\t    {\"ordinal\": 2, \"title\": \"Highest-density metal and structural relevance\", \"instruction\": \"The metal with the highest density among those in the KB is identified, accompanied by a brief explanation of why high density is significant for structural applications. Content is presented in flowing paragraphs.\"},\n9\t    {\"ordinal\": 3, \"title\": \"Iron versus aluminum comparison\", \"instruction\": \"The key differences between iron and aluminum are summarized as a short comparison, drawing on data available in the KB. Content is presented as a concise comparison.\"}\n10\t  ],\n11\t  \"constraints\": [\n12\t    \"Output language: English.\",\n13\t    \"All data and claims derive from the KB provided.\"\n14\t  ]\n15\t}\n16\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"91f732f4-a3a9-403c-abca-87ea1e7eb0d9","uuid":"b3fb746e-2a43-47e7-ae43-3aeb320ea30e","timestamp":"2026-03-31T01:16:44.737Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/research/smoketest/sessions/run-20260330_221630/structured_prompt_spec.json","content":"{\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"task_file\": \"/home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/research/smoketest/md/task.prompt.md\",\n  \"slot_count\": 3,\n  \"constraint_count\": 2,\n  \"slots\": [\n    {\"ordinal\": 1, \"title\": \"Metals ranked by melting point\", \"instruction\": \"All metals referenced in the KB are ranked by melting point from highest to lowest. Content is presented as a sorted list.\"},\n    {\"ordinal\": 2, \"title\": \"Highest-density metal and structural relevance\", \"instruction\": \"The metal with the highest density among those in the KB is identified, accompanied by a brief explanation of why high density is significant for structural applications. Content is presented in flowing paragraphs.\"},\n    {\"ordinal\": 3, \"title\": \"Iron versus aluminum comparison\", \"instruction\": \"The key differences between iron and aluminum are summarized as a short comparison, drawing on data available in the KB. Content is presented as a concise comparison.\"}\n  ],\n  \"constraints\": [\n    \"Output language: English.\",\n    \"All data and claims derive from the KB provided.\"\n  ]\n}\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
